# Fork-point blob manifest for the vendored DexKit Core.
#
# One line per vendored file: the git blob SHA-1 that file had at the
# UPSTREAM baseline recorded in ./UPSTREAM (LuckyPray/DexKit dff66e8), NOT
# its current content.  A file whose on-disk bytes hash to the SHA below is
# byte-identical to upstream; every other file is a divergence and must have
# an entry in docs/dexkit-vendor-divergences.md.
#
# The hash is git's own: sha1(b'blob %d\0' % len(bytes) + bytes).
# Regenerate with the command recorded in ./UPSTREAM.
#
